VisualOn AAC encoder source vendored for the self-contained target build.

Upstream: https://github.com/mstorsjo/vo-aacenc.git
Commit: a277487e051e92e99a532294eed3c673f4d879f2
License: Apache-2.0 (see COPYING and NOTICE)

Only the portable encoder, common memory helper, and required headers are
included. Sample programs, Android framework wrappers, documentation, and
32-bit ARM assembly are intentionally omitted. The camera uses the portable
fixed-point implementation on AArch64.
